      "id": 1,
      "text": "Before World War II, Shard End was a purely rural area of Warwickshire, with only farmhouses and tithe cottages dotting the landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
